            {
                "entry_id": "b3b4d341-45e8-3f14-a317-caca48584b33",
                "word": "Overground",
                "pos": "name",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "de40eca6-7cc1-4398-bf5f-e6ce49939105",
                        "entry_id": "b3b4d341-45e8-3f14-a317-caca48584b33",
                        "tags": [
                            "canonical"
                        ],
                        "form": "the Overground"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5c41ab5d-7e93-393a-ac56-9c58a58ea719",
                        "entry_id": "b3b4d341-45e8-3f14-a317-caca48584b33",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The London Overground, a counterpart of London Underground operated by TfL (Transport for London), which operates some of the various lines around London which are mainly above ground."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9fc9da92-3a62-412c-954c-76b97bd50d9a",
                                "sense_id": "5c41ab5d-7e93-393a-ac56-9c58a58ea719",
                                "text": "Yes, it was rather bizarre to make a former underground line into part of a network called London Overground, and at Whitechapel the Overground goes under the Underground. But let's not spoil our happy ending for the East London Line."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [],
                "word_linkages": []
            },
            {
                "entry_id": "a3b5bd06-f402-3b5f-a05f-966ac20e6679",
                "word": "overground",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "20937029-1049-4cc1-8bff-fab8cb24bf7b",
                        "entry_id": "a3b5bd06-f402-3b5f-a05f-966ac20e6679",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "overgrounds"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "dca5490c-71f6-396e-b1d9-40553dd34675",
                        "entry_id": "a3b5bd06-f402-3b5f-a05f-966ac20e6679",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A commuter rail or similar rail transport system, or a train in such systems, generally running through an urban area largely above ground and faster than an underground or metro with fewer stops."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "London"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "bdd6567f-5c2e-4d9f-a8f6-28ce53b88617",
                                "sense_id": "dca5490c-71f6-396e-b1d9-40553dd34675",
                                "text": "The overground is ten minutes walk through the gloom. Anna finds a seat in the third carriage she tries."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "025896d5-9f88-433f-8021-a646436abaa0",
                                "sense_id": "dca5490c-71f6-396e-b1d9-40553dd34675",
                                "text": "Today dozens more systems are being built – or at least being planned with twelve in China alone – and that's not counting the overgrounds and the tramways!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29903bc8-d089-42f3-b513-3a78cadaac0a",
                                "sense_id": "dca5490c-71f6-396e-b1d9-40553dd34675",
                                "text": "TfL has released an official map showing how the new Elizabeth Line will slot in with the existing stations, Tube lines and overgrounds."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1079a793-7901-4262-b92e-d31da97cc376",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3b5bd06-f402-3b5f-a05f-966ac20e6679",
                        "source_sense_id": "dca5490c-71f6-396e-b1d9-40553dd34675",
                        "source_sense_description": "railway",
                        "target_lang_word": "train de banlieue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0ebc7ee5-82c9-4665-9b77-8c6ab273eb1c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a3b5bd06-f402-3b5f-a05f-966ac20e6679",
                        "source_sense_id": "dca5490c-71f6-396e-b1d9-40553dd34675",
                        "source_sense_description": "railway",
                        "target_lang_word": "S-Bahn",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "S-Bahn",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cecc541d-62f6-31a7-88aa-93613b1eb974",
                                        "entry_id": "d35c02a1-6e9c-3904-bb0a-43608659da5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Schnellbahn, schienengebundene Nahverkehrslinie, meist auf Eisenbahnstrecken"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e7eee23-f13b-4120-8405-4ef4737f6cf9",
                                                "sense_id": "cecc541d-62f6-31a7-88aa-93613b1eb974",
                                                "text": "Weißt du, wann die S-Bahn hier einen neuen Bahnhof bekommt?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "90bd1976-6c78-4a3e-ba5f-c1dc06929a5d",
                                                "sense_id": "cecc541d-62f6-31a7-88aa-93613b1eb974",
                                                "text": "„Zentral gelegen ist auch dieser Ort nicht, doch der Weg zur S-Bahn ist sehr kurz, die Gegend wohnlich, die Studenten einer nahen Privatuniversität lassen sich blicken, helfen mit.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9494d4be-2912-3f8b-ad73-0e6b1ede9f38",
                                        "entry_id": "d35c02a1-6e9c-3904-bb0a-43608659da5d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "S-Bahn-Zug, S-Bahn-Wagen, also das Fahrzeug für [1]"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Kurzform für"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1471f006-95e5-4950-8bbb-07f3e519ba00",
                                                "sense_id": "9494d4be-2912-3f8b-ad73-0e6b1ede9f38",
                                                "text": "Die S-Bahn fährt uns weg!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8f70cfe6-9f04-4421-99fb-48610926a535",
                                                "sense_id": "9494d4be-2912-3f8b-ad73-0e6b1ede9f38",
                                                "text": "„Er musste von der U-Bahn in die S-Bahn umsteigen und später noch in die Elektrische - aber sie ließ sich nicht abschütteln.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b8ac677b-97d6-4b92-a63e-1848f6e8fc36",
                                                "sense_id": "9494d4be-2912-3f8b-ad73-0e6b1ede9f38",
                                                "text": "„Ich wäre sehr gerne einfach in eine S-Bahn gestiegen und weit damit gefahren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6dac6f7-0c53-48be-8948-15f0366c5775",
                                                "sense_id": "9494d4be-2912-3f8b-ad73-0e6b1ede9f38",
                                                "text": "„Lassehn hat die S-Bahn am Schlesischen Bahnhof bestiegen, um nach Charlottenburg zu fahren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49d4a11b-7724-4cce-98a8-71ab04d3564d",
                                                "sense_id": "9494d4be-2912-3f8b-ad73-0e6b1ede9f38",
                                                "text": "„Die S-Bahn von Potsdam zum Stettiner Bahnhof verkehrt wie stets, an all den Ruinen vorüber, die das Berliner Stadtbild prägen.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
